    {
      "factId": "mosquito-coil-draft-001",
      "topicId": "mosquito_coil",
      "factText": "蚊香可以先把木屑或木纤维与黏结材料压成板，再冲切出螺旋；有效成分既可混进材料，也可在成形后涂到表面。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-mosquito-coil-fibre-board"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "mosquito-coil-draft-002",
      "topicId": "mosquito_coil",
      "factText": "常见双盘蚊香不是两片分别冲出来：模具会在同一张材料片里切出彼此嵌套的两条螺旋，干燥后再轻轻分开。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-mosquito-coil-nested-cutting"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "mosquito-coil-draft-003",
      "topicId": "mosquito_coil",
      "factText": "蚊香不一定整圈等宽：有的设计让先燃烧的外段更粗、内段较细且截面恒定，使前段释放更快，随后转为较稳定的释放。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-mosquito-coil-variable-section"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    }
